    "description": "Located in the heart of the sought-after Castro district, this Victorian gem, built in 1900, is a rare find. The 2,816-square-foot property features two expansive flats, each with high ceilings, intricate crown molding, classic wainscoting, and stunning stained glass windows. The sunlit upper unit offers 2 bedrooms, an office, a large dining room, and an updated kitchen, while the lower unit offers a similar floor plan and includes 2 bedrooms, a full bathroom, and an additional half bathroom.    The spacious garage provides multiple parking spaces, room for a workshop, and a spa area with a hot tub, sauna, and bathroom, plus potential for an ADU. The 3,206-square-foot lot boasts a lush garden, perfect for al fresco dining and creating a serene urban retreat. Just minutes from dining, nightlife, boutiques, and cafes, with easy access to public transportation, this is quintessential San Francisco living."
  },
